+
+
+Show the Config
+---------------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command prints the app's configuration
+as JSON. The value of any key that contains ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``,
+``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` is masked with ``***``, so the output can be shared
+without leaking credentials. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI": "sqlite:///hello.db",
+      "TESTING": false
+    }
